+### Generated-semantics concrete execution
+
+Fresh LLVM `krun` executions covered `-1, 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 8, 9, 25, 70, 999,
+1000003`. Every `krun` invocation exited 0. For positive inputs, the K result
